    title: "THE LEGALITY OF NO REFUND POLICY UNDER NIGERIAN CONSUMER PROTECTION LAW",
    category: "Dispute Resolution",
    date: "2026-08-14",
    readTime: "1 min read",
    excerpt: "A \"No Refund\" sign doesn't override Nigerian consumer law. Under the Federal Competition and Consumer Protection Act 2019, businesses can't contract out of the rights the Act gives consumers.",
